  "details": "At least add an option for me to revert to the old main menu, it doesn't make sense for you to move features all the way to the top! It awkwardly blocks almost the entire top half of my screen  now, and it feels clunky. \n\nHaving the notification bar at the top is clunky and out of the way, whereas when it was at the bottom left it was just right there and easy to click on. Having everything now awkwardly be spread out from top to bottom with not much of a semblance as to why it's there is even more confusing. \n\nAlso, now it's even more confusing to find where your bio is?? Seriously?\n\nIt'd make more sense if the VRC+ , Marketplace and maybe Group tab got switched to the top bar , where it's more miniscule and hidden, versus having the vital Notification Bar, Settings Menu and Shield menu obscured at the top.",
